  dialogueID: Yeti_Intro
  conversation:
  - Hey there, little guy.
  - Pieces? Ah! I picked one up on my morning walk today.
  - I was looking around for chickens, but I hear they're only in the fire realm.
  - Would you mind getting some of those FAMOUS golden eggs for me?
  - I hear they're great fried.
  - Then, I promise, I'll give you the piece I'm hanging onto.
  seen: 0
